Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.16,0:23:14.21,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一側 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.32,0:23:20.16,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日漸頹敗 卻仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.35,0:23:26.07,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的這份寂寞
